      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Channel Splitter takes a picture apart into four numbers, R, G, B and A, and RGBA puts four numbers back together. Cabled straight across, the waving flag would come back as it was; here every channel moves one along, so red becomes green, green blue and blue red. Re-cable them, or put a Red, Hue or Lightness node in one's place."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
